OBJECTIVE
---------
Native SwiftUI/HIG parity of the web page TeslaRegionPage
(web/src/features/admin/pages/TeslaRegionPage.tsx, route /tesla-region),
adaptive across macOS + iOS/iPadOS (ADR-002/006).

Parity unit (apps/parity/parity-manifest.json → page:admin/TeslaRegion):
